extends ../layouts/main

block content
  section.hero-section
    .container
      .row.align-items-center.g-5
        .col-lg-6
          span.eyebrow Learning for life
          h1 Quality education. Strong foundations. Brighter futures.
          p.hero-lead Louise Junior School is a high-quality, low-cost education model school committed to helping children build the skills, confidence and curiosity they need to thrive.
          .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-3.mt-4
            a.btn.btn-brand.btn-lg(href='/admissions') Enquire about admissions
            a.btn.btn-outline-brand.btn-lg(href='/about') Discover Louise Junior School
          .hero-note.mt-4
            span.note-mark ✓
            span Foundations in reading, mathematics, mentorship and practical learning
        .col-lg-6
          .hero-image-wrap
            img.hero-image(src='/images/hero-classroom.jpg' alt='Louise Junior School learners in a classroom' onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/classroom-placeholder.svg'")
            .hero-image-caption
              strong Education is life
              span Every learner matters
  section.py-5
    .container
      .section-heading.text-center.mx-auto
        span.eyebrow What we do
        h2 Learning that prepares children for life
        p We combine strong academic foundations with support, mentorship and experiences that help learners grow.
      .row.g-4.mt-2
        .col-md-6.col-lg-3
          .feature-card
            .feature-icon 01
            h3 Literacy & numeracy
            p Building confident readers and capable problem-solvers.
        .col-md-6.col-lg-3
          .feature-card
            .feature-icon 02
            h3 Academic support
            p Giving learners the guidance and practice they need to progress.
        .col-md-6.col-lg-3
          .feature-card
            .feature-icon 03
            h3 Mentorship
            p Encouraging character, confidence and positive choices.
        .col-md-6.col-lg-3
          .feature-card
            .feature-icon 04
            h3 Activities & discovery
            p Connecting classroom learning to practical, real-life experiences.
  section.section-soft.py-5
    .container
      .row.align-items-center.g-5
        .col-lg-6
          img.content-image(src='/images/pupils-learning.jpg' alt='Learners working together' onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/classroom-placeholder.svg'")
        .col-lg-6
          span.eyebrow Our approach
          h2 Learner-centred teaching, shared growth
          p We believe children learn best when lessons connect to real life, learners support one another and teachers continually improve their practice.
          ul.check-list
            li Practical and relevant learning
            li Peer-to-peer learning
            li Teacher planning, training and peer review
            li Parent engagement and support at home
          a.text-link(href='/academics') Explore our learning approach →
  section.py-5
    .container
      .row.g-5.align-items-center
        .col-lg-5
          span.eyebrow Families and community
          h2 Education grows stronger when we work together
          p Parents, teachers and community partners all play an important role in helping children attend school, learn well and complete their education.
          a.btn.btn-brand(href='/impact') Partner with Louise Junior School
        .col-lg-7
          .row.g-3
            .col-6: img.gallery-tile(src='/images/teacher-training.jpg' alt='Teacher development' onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/classroom-placeholder.svg'")
            .col-6: img.gallery-tile.mt-4(src='/images/school-activities.jpg' alt='School activities' onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/classroom-placeholder.svg'")
  section.cta-section.py-5
    .container.text-center
      span.eyebrow.text-white-50 Join our community
      h2 Learn more about Louise Junior School
      p Discover our approach, ask about admissions or explore ways to support our work.
      a.btn.btn-light.btn-lg(href='/contact') Contact the school
